                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W4610800                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCHAR W47920-FIL OCH W44061 (RESTORDERFIL).         *        
*                OM ORDER SOM RENSATS FINNS PÅ RESTORDERREGISTRET SKA  *        
*                EJ RENSNINGSTRANS SKICKAS VIDARE TILL VIPS.           *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  ELAINE CURTSSON                                       *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  MAJ 93                                                *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*   RENSNINGSTRANSAR                   *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
FILE W46108D1                                                                   
%W461S051                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  W44061 RESTORDERREGISTER            *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W46108D2                                                                   
%W44060                                                                         
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  TEMPFIL1                            *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE TEMPFIL1 VIRTUAL FB(61 27938)                                              
%W461S051 'TEMP1-'                                                              
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  TEMPFIL2                            *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE TEMPFIL2 VIRTUAL FB(13 27989)                                              
TEMP2-POST      1 13 A                                                          
TEMP2-IDDISTR   1  3 P 0                                                        
TEMP2-IDKUNDNR  4  4 P 0                                                        
TEMP2-IDORDNR   8  4 P 0                                                        
TEMP2-IDDC      12 2 A                                                          
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL MED RENSNINGSTRANSAR          *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W46108D3 VB(61 27938)                                                      
%W461S051  'UT-'                                                                
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  PACKAR ORDERNR FRÅN RENSNINGSFILEN  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W46108D2                                                              
*                                                                               
     TEMP2-IDDISTR   = RAD-IDDISTR                                              
     TEMP2-IDKUNDNR  = RAD-IDKUNDNR                                             
     TEMP2-IDORDNR   = RAD-IDORDNR5                                             
     TEMP2-IDDC      = RAD-IDDC                                                 
     PUT TEMPFIL2                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  SORTERING                           *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
SORT W46108D1 TO +                                                              
     TEMPFIL1 USING (RENS-IDDISTR RENS-IDKUNDNR RENS-IDORDNR +                  
                     RENS-IDDC)                                                 
*                                                                               
SORT TEMPFIL2 TO +                                                              
     TEMPFIL2 USING (TEMP2-IDDISTR TEMP2-IDKUNDNR TEMP2-IDORDNR +               
                     TEMP2-IDDC)                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  MATCHAR TEMPFIL1 OCH TEMPFIL2       *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (TEMPFIL1 KEY(TEMP1-RENS-IDDISTR TEMP1-RENS-IDKUNDNR      +           
                        TEMP1-RENS-IDORDNR TEMP1-RENS-IDDC)         +           
           TEMPFIL2 KEY(TEMP2-IDDISTR TEMP2-IDKUNDNR TEMP2-IDORDNR  +           
                        TEMP2-IDDC))                                            
                                                                                
    IF NOT MATCHED                                                              
       IF TEMPFIL1                                                              
          PUT W46108D3 FROM TEMPFIL1                                            
       END-IF                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
